ers to new approver 3da95cd2167b75dfb948f82a8317cba0: exp-2c70501e for worker 3b08c6e33c7295782d6c797f8f7d9b78; exp-e8147dc9 and exp-scn-C5002 for worker a44a4d468918b6824f4a353e74300513. Leave Kofi Silva's own pending report exp-2e87d415 routed to Jordan Carter because Kofi is not an affected worker in these events.\",\n      \"tools\": [\"fin_reroute_expense_report\", \"fin_get_expense_reports\"],\n      \"case_id\": \"case-manager-change-2026-11-01-5186ee32-to-3da95cd2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"system\": \"finance\",\n      \"action\": \"Verify final Finance state: the four affected worker profiles have expense_approver_wid 3da95cd2167b75dfb948f82a8317cba0; pending reports exp-2c70501e, exp-e8147dc9, and exp-scn-C5002 are routed to 3da95cd2167b75dfb948f82a8317cba0; and no unrelated approvals were moved from 5186ee32ee8d7ee9770348a05d300cb9.\",\n      \"tools\": [\"fin_get_profile\", \"fin_get_expense_reports\", \"fin_get_approval_delegations\"],\n      \"case_id\": \"case-manager-change-2026-11-01-5186ee32-to-3da95cd2\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"escalations\": []\n}\n```"
